let __v_2676 = Value::from("A tight chest has three common causes and they feel much alike. Asthma: a wheeze, a cough at night or with cold air or exercise, which eases with a blue reliever inhaler. Anxiety: a fast heart, tingling hands, and it comes in waves of ten or twenty minutes, often when you are wound up. A chest infection: a fever, a wet cough and feeling rough, which needs seeing if you are breathless or it is going on. Sudden tightness with pain spreading to the jaw, neck or arm, sweating, or breathlessness while sitting still is 999. If it keeps coming back, see a GP and say when it happens - they may give you a peak flow meter or an inhaler to try.");
