let __v_3123 = Value::from("Get it checked by a GP within two weeks. A mole that changes shape, edge, colour or size, or bleeds, itches or crusts on its own, wants a look rather than a wait, though almost all of them turn out to be nothing. The signs worth saying out loud are the ABCDE ones: not symmetrical, a ragged or blurry border, more than one colour, wider than about 6mm, or changing in any way. Photograph it beside a coin for scale and ring the surgery rather than waiting to see whether it settles.");
